{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.046511627815394085,"w":0.069958845774332645,"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"1718867188","x":0.7716049391467531,"c":0.5},{"x":0.11522634243634533,"y":0.053779069623613118,"c":1,"h":0.014536595878106739,"t":"Sample Writing answers","w":0.21604937235514321},{"x":0.11522634095693685,"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 2","h":0.02040190971922673,"c":1,"y":0.097383720741051727,"w":0.33744855244954425},{"x":0.11522633105551232,"w":0.65226338704427089,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score.","y":0.13221436958309818},{"c":1,"t":"It is said that taking risks brings a lot of benefits. However, it also gives us some drawbacks.","y":0.15694935199173721,"x":0.11728395933493867,"h":0.018922740635237245,"w":0.72016459147135425},{"x":0.11728394264749398,"y":0.18313953527260507,"w":0.77366256713867188,"t":"First of all, it is obvious that taking risks will cause a great loss if people do it and fail. In personal","c":1,"h":0.018895348053517669},{"w":0.7202963256835937,"t":"lite, this loss might not be so harmful. However, it will be really harmfull in professional life,","h":0.021195101653729176,"c":1,"x":0.11514643619406513,"y":0.2010191148072682},{"w":0.73882843017578126,"y":0.22080794833669937,"h":0.019097583173161015,"c":1,"t":"because people take a responsibility not only for themselves but also others such as colleages,","x":0.1151537786091735},{"c":1,"t":"customers and their families. It will even damage the society from the economic point.","w":0.6748971048990885,"h":0.017667844522968101,"x":0.1152263445590027,"y":0.24116607773432319},{"y":0.26737338052307413,"h":0.018963828384525261,"t":"On the other hand, we can receive huge benefits by taking risks. Firstly, we can learn how to","c":1,"x":0.11522632886261448,"w":0.72222223917643225},{"y":0.28621908100784554,"c":1,"t":"prepare for one goal through this process. In order to achieve the aim, people will make all the","x":0.11728395554311533,"w":0.74485595703124996,"h":0.019140164899882128},{"y":0.30364950413766545,"w":0.72447016398111985,"c":1,"x":0.11512167176827517,"h":0.021412497836091671,"t":"efforts to think about it and try to find more efficient way. If they do this in the protessional"},{"w":0.65226338704427089,"t":"circumstances, they will recognise the responsibility and importance of cooperation.","y":0.3241279073640696,"h":0.018922740635237134,"x":0.11522633107126448,"c":1},{"y":0.35174418588697809,"x":0.11728396085618423,"h":0.01751376490149259,"c":1,"w":0.76543207804361979,"t":"Also, it will be completely meaningful even though people can't achieve the goal after taking risks."},{"y":0.37063953527245896,"w":0.77983540852864586,"h":0.018936436926096922,"c":1,"t":"They will learn the reason why they have failed and how to change it. The failure will enable them to","x":0.11522632855291495},{"y":0.38953488353411969,"w":0.45061726888020837,"t":"improve their skills and to achieve their object next time.","x":0.11522634481702652,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1},{"w":0.7633744812011718,"c":1,"x":0.11522633998068973,"t":"As I mentioned, it is true that taking risks give us both advantages and disadvantages. However, it","y":0.41569767457425866,"h":0.018931301238258813},{"t":"can be argued that the benefits outweighed the drawbacks in that we can obtain advantages not only","w":0.78395060221354163,"c":1,"y":0.43459302364123276,"x":0.11522634474090987,"h":0.018895348053517669},{"c":1,"x":0.1152263387336636,"y":0.45347467595781743,"w":0.45473251342773435,"h":0.018909044344377457,"t":"from the result but also from the process of taking risks."},{"c":1,"y":0.86773255798110183,"w":0.03497942288716635,"t":"128","x":0.11728395099854647,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.30613845825195307,"y":0.95311055968589831,"x":0.66991094639740412,"h":0.033792529426278195,"c":1}]}